├─25  heading[1]
│     │ depth: 2
│     └─0 text "Docstring formatting"
├─26  paragraph[1]
│     └─0 text "The Ruff formatter provides an opt-in feature for automatically formatting\nPython code examples in docstrings. The Ruff formatter currently recognizes\ncode examples in the following formats:"
